  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fight against discrimination, hate crimes and hate speech in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark supports Georgia in its endeavors to fight discrimination, hate crime and hate speech. The engagement builds on strategic national priorities and legislation, on the priorities of the beneficiary partners, the country&apos;s international commitments and the EU and Council of Europe standards.  The engagement supports the full range in the flow of justice, from improved legislation and policies, enhanced capacity of the justice sector and human rights institutions and awareness raising.</narrative>
  </description>
